{# Primary navigation rendered from an `items` array through a recursive macro —
   entries are never hardcoded, so the same template serves any menu tree.

   Three kinds of row, one macro:

     * a LINK row — icon (or `mark`) plus label, with a chevron button beside it
       when it has children;
     * a GROUP HEADING (`heading: true`) — one disclosure button spanning the
       whole row, no `href` and no `aria-current`, because a heading has no
       destination. Its children are NOT indented: what distinguishes a team row
       from a top-level entry is its mark, not its inset;
     * either of those carrying at most one `action` (the create affordance) and
       at most one `menu` (the dot menu). Both are single objects rather than
       arrays: the dot menu IS the overflow, so a 28px row has no use for an
       unbounded control strip.

   Every open/closed state is an accessible attribute and nothing else. A
   disclosure trigger carries `aria-expanded` and an `aria-controls` pointing at
   its panel; the panel carries that very same id and starts `hidden` while
   closed. Alpine only binds those attributes — no CSS class carries state, in
   either direction.

   Each row is its own Alpine scope with two independent properties: `open` for
   the sub-navigation panel and `menuOpen` for the dot menu. A nested row's
   scope shadows its parent's, so rows toggle independently, which is what the
   deleted nav.js achieved by wiring each trigger to the panel its own
   `aria-controls` named.

   htmx boost swaps the whole rail on every navigation, so the `open` the user
   chose is kept in localStorage (`bakers.nav.<url or title>`) and read back on
   init. Only a user toggle or the active trail writes it, never the server
   default, so stories with different defaults cannot leak into each other;
   `$persist` would write the default on init. A row on the active trail opens
   and stores open, so the current page is never inside a closed group. `menuOpen` is a transient popup and stays
   unstored.

   The chevron is rendered TWICE with each copy bound to `hidden`, because an
   `include`d component cannot be bound from outside. The server still emits
   exactly one visible chevron with JavaScript disabled, which is what the
   single `is_open ? 'chevron-down' : 'chevron-right'` include used to do.

   `is_open` is resolved per entry: an explicit `open` wins, otherwise the coarse
   `expanded` prop and the active trail decide, exactly as before. That is what
   makes "Workspace and Teams open, Settings closed" expressible in one tree.

   Collapsed, the rail keeps every surface it reaches when expanded: link rows
   stay as their icons, a group heading that carries an icon stays as that icon,
   and team rows stay as their marks. What goes is what a 56px rail cannot
   honour — labels, a heading without an icon, and any control whose target is a
   hidden list. Each of those carries `data-collapse-hidden`, which is the
   sidebar's generic contract, so the rail never needs to know what this
   component is made of. #}
{% import _self as nav %}
{% set nav_id = id|default('bakers-navigation') %}
{% set disclose = expanded|default(variant == 'settings_open') %}
<nav{{ (attributes ?: create_attribute()).addClass(['flex', 'flex-col', 'flex-1', 'text-body']) }}
  id="{{ nav_id }}"
  data-navigation
  aria-label="{{ label|default('Primary') }}">
  <ul class="list-none p-0 flex flex-col flex-1 gap-inline-xs">
    {% for item in items|default([]) %}
      {{ nav.entry(item, nav_id ~ '-' ~ loop.index, collapsed|default(false), disclose) }}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</nav>

{% macro entry(item, key, collapsed, disclose) %}
  {% import _self as nav %}
  {% set children = item.below|default([]) %}
  {% set panel_id = key ~ '-panel' %}
  {% set menu_id = key ~ '-menu' %}
  {% set is_heading = item.heading|default(false) %}
  {% set heading_keeps_icon = is_heading and item.icon %}
  {% set is_open = item.open is defined and item.open is not null
    ? item.open
    : (disclose or item.in_active_trail|default(false)) %}
  {% set menu_open = item.menu.open|default(false) %}
  {% set store = ('bakers.nav.' ~ (item.url ?: item.title))|e('js') %}
  {% set in_trail = item.in_active_trail|default(false) %}
  <li class="list-none{{ item.at_end|default(false) ? ' flex flex-col flex-1 justify-end' : '' }}"
    x-data="{ open: {{ is_open ? 'true' : 'false' }}, menuOpen: {{ menu_open ? 'true' : 'false' }},
      {%- if children|length %}
      init() { try { {{ in_trail ? "localStorage.setItem('" ~ store ~ "', true)" : "const v = localStorage.getItem('" ~ store ~ "'); if (v !== null) this.open = v === 'true'" }} } catch (e) {} },
      {%- endif %}
      toggle() { this.open = !this.open; try { localStorage.setItem('{{ store }}', this.open) } catch (e) {} } }">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-inline-xs"
      {%- if is_heading and not heading_keeps_icon %} data-collapse-hidden{% if collapsed %} hidden{% endif %}{% endif %}>
      {% if is_heading %}
        <button type="button"
          class="flex items-center gap-inline-xs flex-1 min-w-0 h-10 px-stack rounded-sm bg-transparent border-0 text-text-faint cursor-pointer text-label transition-colors duration-fast hover:bg-surface hover:text-text focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring{{ heading_keeps_icon ? ' group-[.is-collapsed]:justify-center group-[.is-collapsed]:px-0' : '' }}"
          data-navigation-toggle
          aria-label="{{ item.title }}"
          aria-controls="{{ panel_id }}"
          aria-expanded="{{ is_open ? 'true' : 'false' }}"
          @click="toggle()"
          :aria-expanded="open ? 'true' : 'false'">
          <span class="inline-flex" data-collapse-hidden{% if collapsed %} hidden{% endif %}>
            <span {% if not is_open %}hidden{% endif %} :hidden="!open">
              {{- include('bb_theme:icon', { name: 'chevron-down', size: 'sm' }, with_context = false) -}}
            </span>
            <span {% if is_open %}hidden{% endif %} :hidden="open">
              {{- include('bb_theme:icon', { name: 'chevron-right', size: 'sm' }, with_context = false) -}}
            </span>
          </span>
          {%- if item.icon %}
            {{- include('bb_theme:icon', { name: item.icon, size: 'md' }, with_context = false) -}}
          {%- endif %}
          <span class="truncate" data-collapse-hidden{% if collapsed %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ item.title }}</span>
        </button>
      {% else %}
        <a href="{{ item.url }}" aria-label="{{ item.title }}" title="{{ item.title }}"
          class="flex items-center gap-stack flex-1 min-w-0 h-10 px-stack rounded-sm no-underline transition-colors duration-fast focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring group-[.is-collapsed]:justify-center group-[.is-collapsed]:px-0 {{ item.in_active_trail|default(false) ? 'bg-primary/10 text-primary text-body-strong' : 'text-text-light hover:bg-surface hover:text-text' }}"
          {%- if item.full_page|default(false) %} data-hx-boost="false"{% endif %}
          {%- if item.in_active_trail|default(false) %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>
          {%- if item.mark %}
            {{- include('bb_theme:person', { variant: 'compact', initials: item.mark.initials, color: item.mark.color, size: 'sm' }, with_context = false) -}}
          {%- elseif item.icon %}
            {{- include('bb_theme:icon', { name: item.icon, size: 'md' }, with_context = false) -}}
          {%- endif %}
          <span class="truncate" data-collapse-hidden{% if collapsed %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ item.title }}</span>
        </a>
      {% endif %}
      {% if item.action %}
        <span class="shrink-0"
          data-collapse-hidden{% if collapsed %} hidden{% endif %}>
          {{- include('bb_theme:button', {
            variant: 'ghost',
            icon_only: true,
            type: 'button',
            href: item.action.href|default(''),
            attributes: item.action.attributes|default(create_attribute()),
            label: item.action.label|default('Add'),
            icon: include('bb_theme:icon', { name: item.action.icon|default('plus'), size: 'sm' }, with_context = false),
          }, with_context = false) -}}
        </span>
      {% endif %}
      {% if item.menu %}
        <div class="relative shrink-0"
          data-collapse-hidden{% if collapsed %} hidden{% endif %}>
          <button type="button"
            class="inline-grid place-items-center w-6 h-6 rounded-xs bg-transparent border-0 text-text-faint cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-fast hover:bg-surface hover:text-text focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring"
            data-navigation-menu-toggle
            aria-haspopup="menu"
            aria-controls="{{ menu_id }}"
            aria-expanded="{{ menu_open ? 'true' : 'false' }}"
            aria-label="{{ item.menu.label|default(item.title ~ ' actions') }}"
            @click="menuOpen = !menuOpen"
            :aria-expanded="menuOpen ? 'true' : 'false'">
            {{ include('bb_theme:icon', { name: 'more-horizontal', size: 'sm' }, with_context = false) }}
          </button>
          <ul class="absolute right-0 top-full z-10 min-w-40 list-none p-inline-xs rounded-sm bg-surface-2 border border-border text-body"
            id="{{ menu_id }}"
            role="menu"
            :hidden="!menuOpen"
            {%- if not menu_open %} hidden{% endif %}>
            {% for menu_item in item.menu.items|default([]) %}
              <li class="list-none" role="none">
                <a href="{{ menu_item.url }}"
                  role="menuitem"
                  class="block px-inline py-inline-xs rounded-xs no-underline text-text-light transition-colors duration-fast hover:bg-surface-3 hover:text-text focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring">{{ menu_item.label }}</a>
              </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if children|length and not is_heading %}
        <button type="button"
          class="inline-grid place-items-center w-6 h-6 shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-transparent border-0 text-text-faint cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-fast hover:bg-surface hover:text-text focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring"
          data-navigation-toggle
          data-collapse-hidden
          aria-controls="{{ panel_id }}"
          aria-expanded="{{ is_open ? 'true' : 'false' }}"
          aria-label="{{ item.title }} sub-navigation"
          @click="toggle()"
          :aria-expanded="open ? 'true' : 'false'"
          {%- if collapsed %} hidden{% endif %}>
          <span {% if not is_open %}hidden{% endif %} :hidden="!open">
            {{- include('bb_theme:icon', { name: 'chevron-down', size: 'sm' }, with_context = false) -}}
          </span>
          <span {% if is_open %}hidden{% endif %} :hidden="open">
            {{- include('bb_theme:icon', { name: 'chevron-right', size: 'sm' }, with_context = false) -}}
          </span>
        </button>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if children|length %}
      <ul class="list-none p-0 pt-inline-xs {{ is_heading ? '' : 'pl-gutter group-[.is-collapsed]:hidden' }} flex flex-col gap-inline-xs"
        id="{{ panel_id }}"
        :hidden="!open"
        {%- if not is_open %} hidden{% endif %}>
        {% for child in children %}
          {{ nav.entry(child, panel_id ~ '-' ~ loop.index, collapsed, disclose) }}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% endif %}
  </li>
{% endmacro %}
